  "notes": "Fixture-only adaptation of Pass 32 cards KFM-P32-IDEA-0013 and KFM-P32-PROG-0007. The profile reuses the existing EvidenceBundle, stores opaque asset references and ETag digests, binds deterministic hashes and analysis identity, distinguishes POPULATED/EMPTY/NO_DATA, and proves exact synthetic positive/negative behavior. It performs no live source access, environmental computation, observation claim, evidence resolution, policy evaluation, lifecycle write, release, deployment, publication, or public-use authorization. The implementation separates schema/profile orchestration, shared value helpers, deterministic ordering checks, semantic checks, and compact fixture materialization into bounded modules without changing the authority boundary."
